From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sidelady <sidelady@local>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 22:12:45 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] UI/Qt: Wire TreeTabController lifecycle hooks and context
 menu actions


diff --git a/UI/Qt/Application.cpp b/UI/Qt/Application.cpp
index 5207cd38..b3467e14 100644
--- a/UI/Qt/Application.cpp
+++ b/UI/Qt/Application.cpp
@@ -63,6 +63,8 @@
 #include <UI/Qt/EventLoopImplementationQt.h>
